{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51828","headline":"题秋风（句） · 杨兴义","name":"题秋风（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜风一夜将红叶，换尽江头万木青。\n（《蜀中名胜记》二五《保宁府·巴州》）（〖1〗《蜀中名胜记》称「唐进士杨兴义」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨兴义","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}